			"notes": "# v2.2版本更新日志：\n添加了/ai-safty命令\n作用：将世界数据每隔一分钟发送给AI，AI分析得出危险实体与危险方块的位置以及距离\n根据颜色来判断当前你的处境\n可以说，有了它，再也不用担心下个矿洞被黑暗处的怪物贴脸，垂直挖矿时再也不用担心掉进岩浆\n用法：先使用/ai-config set-key 配置好API密钥，然后输入/ai-safty命令开启AI安全监控（/ai-safty命令为开关模式）\n注意，由于此功能开启后会频繁调用API，而deepseek按输出token计费，所以请留意你的余额\n![2025-06-10_00 33 44](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25d97794-a56a-4d5e-9bca-78d6d6acb50f)\n![2025-06-10_00 04 42](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9f21402-61f7-4469-ae19-f488c32f0a06)\n![2025-06-10_00 05 49](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5dd00e55-5399-4d7e-9c37-2ab10df79553)\n![2025-06-10_00 08 04](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb52177b-c651-4efc-bb7a-b94d8dc303c5)\n![2025-06-10_00 11 31](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3e73bde-1941-403c-bb7d-6939f04ebb0f)\n![2025-06-10_00 12 39](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63f24c44-1c3a-45d8-a7cc-316003105ba1)\n![2025-06-10_00 13 49](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59a10e89-edd7-4707-8bf7-e9141b6b9af6)\n![2025-06-10_00 18 20](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07de8701-2b9c-48b8-a39e-b59ad92ac468)\n![2025-06-10_00 20 37](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7317d9ef-839d-4d03-8ef9-c16f4a141c82)\n![2025-06-10_00 25 34](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/271930f0-45ac-42c4-991d-045f6b2d1baf)"
